# Users allowed to ask hermes-kms-card-broker for a virtual display card.
#
# One user name or numeric uid per line; '#' starts a comment. The file is read
# on every request, so adding or removing a line takes effect immediately - no
# restart, no logout.
#
# A listed user can create up to four cards, each on its own private DRM seat,
# and can remove only the cards it created. Listing a user is the whole of the
# authorization: keep this file root-owned and mode 0644.
#
# hermes
